<title>USA: Meridian Data to halt share repurchases.</title>
<headline>Meridian Data to halt share repurchases.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTS VALLEY, Calif. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meridian Data Inc said it will temporarily halt its share repurchase program in June, and may again resume repurchasing shares in mid-July, once Meridian's second quarter results of operations have been announced.</p>
<p>It said it has repurchased a total of 1,025,000 shares, or about 11 percent of its stock, under its buyback program, announced in the third quarter of 1996.</p>
